# Track 6.1 Slice 2 — Generic workload observation bridge — COMPLETE

Date: 2026-09-10
Branch: `build/initial-product`

## Result

Track 6 item 1 now has a trustworthy generic observation → state path for one already-selected stable workload. This is an additive Core foundation; the existing specialized BlueStacks/Free Fire Guardian remains unchanged.

Permanent implementation:

- `docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-10-track6-generic-workload-observation.md`
- `src/FFPerformanceEngine.Core/Services/GenericGuardianWorkloadObservationService.cs`
- `tests/FFPerformanceEngine.Core.SelfTest/GenericGuardianWorkloadObservationSelfTests.cs`
- Core self-test registration in `tests/FFPerformanceEngine.Core.SelfTest/Program.cs`

## Closed behavior

- `IForegroundProcessProbe` reports only foreground PID; it does not infer game identity from window/process names.
- `WindowsForegroundProcessProbe` uses the Windows foreground-window PID as a neutral signal.
- Runtime authority remains `TelemetryWorkloadTargetResolver`; no second PID/path resolver exists.
- Unknown, ambiguous or unavailable workload targets invoke no foreground/input/telemetry probes.
- `KnownExecutable` remains non-live and grants no capture/action authority.
- Global recent input is consulted only when the exact resolved workload PID is foreground; background input cannot be attributed to the workload.
- Typed workload capture is injected through the existing exact-target capture seam and is accepted only when returned GameId/PID/path/binding match the requested exact target.
- Render activity is true only when the exact-target typed frame contains `frame.samples.accepted.count > 0` with `TelemetryMetricQuality.Measured` and `TelemetryMetricOrigin.Direct`.
- Exact-target typed frames remain available to later classifiers even when their accepted-frame metric is not authoritative enough to declare render activity.
- Explicit system offline performs no external probes and flows directly to `Offline` through the existing generic state machine.
- Observation construction has no side effects.
- The observation bridge creates no discovery, baseline, classifier, mutation, canary, profile, History, Guardian Knowledge, startup or WPF authority.

